Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:27.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Moving through the meridians like that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.44,0:02:29.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,consumes too much spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.08,0:02:31.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:33.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, are you crazy !?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.64,0:02:35.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you drink a Desolate Beast's marrow essence,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.24,0:02:37.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,you'll explode from the inside !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.12,0:02:41.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's alright, you can explode then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.32,0:02:43.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't care !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.64,0:02:49.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first spell Ancient Gods learn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:50.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the Ancient God Tactic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.04,0:02:53.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ancient God Clan uses this method
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:56.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,to devour the spiritual energy of all things in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.76,0:02:58.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,No matter how much there is,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.32,0:03:00.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,it can all be devoured.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.68,0:03:02.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's the Ancient God Tactic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.76,0:03:11.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Break !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.68,0:03:23.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't see through this person's cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.08,0:03:25.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the feeling he gives me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.96,0:03:28.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,is even more terrifying than a Soul Formation cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.20,0:03:30.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Still running away ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.36,0:03:33.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.76,0:03:41.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You dare to try to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.44,0:03:43.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,through the meridians with a Core Formation cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:45.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're quite bold, aren't you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.44,0:03:50.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Flood Dragon marrow essence...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.52,0:03:52.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.40,0:03:53.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you recognize this item ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.28,0:03:55.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back in the first trial,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.92,0:03:57.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I subdued a Flood Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.24,0:03:59.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I was done playing with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.00,0:04:01.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I killed it for its marrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:04.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nothing here can catch my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.96,0:04:06.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm very disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.48,0:04:08.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Flood Dragon in the first trial was too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.12,0:04:11.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems that this is all the Land of the Ancient God
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.32,0:04:12.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,has to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.76,0:04:14.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's the one who left that writing !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:17.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you dare to consume Flood Dragon marrow essence
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.56,0:04:19.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,because you're a Soul Devourer ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.76,0:04:20.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.44,0:04:21.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes, my ass !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.72,0:04:23.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,You were about to explode and die !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.80,0:04:26.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is it also because you're a Soul Devourer that you can
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.84,0:04:28.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,move through the Ancient God's meridians ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.72,0:04:30.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.44,0:04:31.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bullshit !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.60,0:04:33.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's clearly because of the Ancient God's inheritance !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.20,0:04:38.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come with me to greet Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.32,0:04:47.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for my special authority,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.48,0:04:49.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,even I wouldn't be able
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.16,0:04:52.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,to move freely within the Ancient God's meridians.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.00,0:04:54.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,This brat
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.88,0:04:57.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,might be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.24,0:05:34.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Duo Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.64,0:05:36.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,pays respects to Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.72,0:05:39.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kneel !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.80,0:05:48.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You talk too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.88,0:05:52.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Master is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.52,0:05:55.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,No spiritual energy fluctuations ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.80,0:05:58.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't even feel his Divine Sense ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.20,0:06:00.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this is pure
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.40,0:06:02.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancient God power !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.88,0:06:03.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.28,0:06:05.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you a Soul Devourer ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.96,0:06:07.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.36,0:06:22.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,As expected...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:32.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Devour it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.12,0:06:59.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look at it !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:02.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,A little brat
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.16,0:07:03.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,only took a few breaths
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.36,0:07:06.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,to break the seal that you trash
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.52,0:07:08.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,couldn't break for thousands of years !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.52,0:07:10.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the next 10 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.04,0:07:14.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,those who cannot refine the Divine Sense seal on their bodies
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.32,0:07:17.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,will serve no more purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:27.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Inheritor,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:30.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,you must never let my memory inheritance
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.76,0:07:33.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,fall in Tuo Sen's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.76,0:07:36.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Remember... Remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.36,0:07:40.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,The day the demon Tuo Sen breaks free
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.08,0:07:42.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be the day
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.00,0:07:45.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,all living beings shall suffer a calamity
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.40,0:07:49.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if I refuse to devour the seal,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.68,0:07:51.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid he'll kill me on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.24,0:07:54.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Soul Devourer is too young.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.24,0:07:57.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Make him condense a Soul Core
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.76,0:08:00.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,or he'll devour too slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:03.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,This subordinate is willing to lend a hand
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.40,0:08:06.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,to make the Soul Devourer condense a Soul Core.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.08,0:08:08.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.16,0:08:30.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.16,0:08:33.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,when I caught you earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.48,0:08:35.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,what were you doing in the Dead Soul Sea ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.04,0:08:38.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, you're a Blood Sea Warrior,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.52,0:08:42.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,why did you bring me to the Nirvana Space of the third trial
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.88,0:08:44.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,where Tuo Sen can't see us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.48,0:08:53.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brat,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.04,0:08:58.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you know how long it has been since someone spoke to me like that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:04.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior, you have some nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.92,0:09:08.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,We aren't really Blood Sea Warriors,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.40,0:09:09.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,the eleven of us
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:13.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,are foreign cultivators trapped here by Tuo Sen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.08,0:09:15.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the past 1000 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.36,0:09:16.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,only 3 people escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.96,0:09:19.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once Tuo Sen breaks the seal,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:21.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:23.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.52,0:09:25.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,answer my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.72,0:09:27.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,What were you doing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.12,0:09:30.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I tried to leave the Land of the Ancient God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.56,0:09:48.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Did you all hear that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.56,0:09:51.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,This little guy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.16,0:09:53.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,has the same goal as us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.08,0:09:56.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,When he breaks Tuo Sen's seal,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.48,0:09:58.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will be our moment to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:01.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Soul Devourer ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.96,0:10:03.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Very good...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.44,0:10:05.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.92,0:10:08.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,once you seal Tuo Sen again,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.48,0:10:11.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will definitely reward you generously.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.20,0:10:14.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, you're too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.68,0:10:16.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,But with my mere Core Formation cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:18.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,sealing an Ancient God
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.04,0:10:19.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,is but a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.60,0:10:22.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,You won't use your cultivation to seal him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.92,0:10:25.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,The seal you will devour
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.08,0:10:27.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the Ancient God's Divine Sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.40,0:10:29.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,You just need to use your Soul Devourer powers
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.84,0:10:32.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,when Tuo Sen enters the Dead Soul Sea
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.72,0:10:35.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,to trigger the Ancient God's Divine Sense to seal Tuo Sen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.60,0:10:36.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.08,0:10:38.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,leave the rest to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.04,0:10:40.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,After we're done,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.28,0:10:43.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will give you 100 top-quality spirit stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.64,0:10:47.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:49.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you not satisfied ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.92,0:10:51.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll also give you a top tier artifact,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.96,0:10:53.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Huan Yuan Beast Trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.52,0:10:56.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is it enough now ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:10:57.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brat,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.80,0:11:01.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you won't cooperate
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.40,0:11:06.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,then we will use another way without a Soul Devourer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.48,0:11:11.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not that I don't trust you Seniors
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.88,0:11:13.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,but this is a matter of life or death,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.64,0:11:15.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need a guarantee from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.84,0:11:18.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you want ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.72,0:11:21.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want your life artifacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.68,0:11:23.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,You !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.68,0:11:24.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:27.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,After all this is done,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.28,0:11:29.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior will give them back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.56,0:11:30.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Seniors
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.24,0:11:33.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,wouldn't worry about a Core Formation Junior like me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.68,0:11:36.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,being able to steal your artifacts for myself, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.16,0:12:24.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a Soul Core.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.48,0:12:26.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Swallow it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.28,0:12:30.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you'll be able to break Tuo Sen's seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.84,0:13:41.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,This day
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.24,0:13:45.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,has finally come...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.72,0:14:09.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Divine Sense barrier ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.20,0:14:13.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tu Si,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.60,0:14:16.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,you couldn't beat me 10 000 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.16,0:14:19.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.48,0:14:21.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,is no different !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.00,0:14:34.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, Tuo Sen,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:36.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,am back !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.64,0:14:43.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tu Si is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.84,0:14:45.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,On Tu Si's behalf,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:48.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I summon his life artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.80,0:14:51.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Star Destroyer Spear,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.88,0:14:52.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,appear...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.12,0:15:19.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I order everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.96,0:15:22.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,to follow me to obtain
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.36,0:15:24.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Ancient God's memory inheritance !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.44,0:16:13.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your life artifact, the Star Destroyer Spear
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.28,0:16:14.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,has already submitted to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:16.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tu Si,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.12,0:16:18.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,you cannot stop me !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.32,0:16:23.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Passage to the Ancient God's memories...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.72,0:16:25.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Appear !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.68,0:16:46.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Duo Mu and the others' positions seem random
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:48.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,but in reality they surrounded Tuo Sen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.16,0:16:52.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are they that confident in dealing with him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:57.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.28,0:16:59.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,why aren't you moving ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.24,0:17:02.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior doesn't need to be so cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.56,0:17:04.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,My cultivation is limited
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.04,0:17:05.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,so I'm a little slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.64,0:17:07.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, I won't delay your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.39,0:19:33.86,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The Soul Core increases a Soul Devourer's power and also strengthens its control over wandering souls. It is generally formed by devouring a huge amount of souls right after becoming a Soul Devourer. Wang Lin didn't form one because he left the Foreign Battlefield too early after becoming a Soul Devourer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.33,0:17:47.21,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Count the specks of time
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.21,0:17:47.21,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}floating down gently.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.57,0:17:53.45,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}The carving knife in your hands etches out destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.57,0:18:00.97,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Forever lock away the scars
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.37,0:18:00.97,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}of this mortal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.23,0:18:07.49,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}This fleeting youth is a thing of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.13,0:18:15.21,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The flying bird could not escape the twilight
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.81,0:18:15.21,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}that fills the sky with a myriad of colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.29,0:18:22.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}The night-blooming flower cannot drink
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.33,0:18:22.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}the crystalization of the golden wind and the jade dew.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.81,0:18:24.89,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I will ask the heavens who exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.89,0:18:29.65,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}sliced open this world
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.29,0:18:29.65,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}to let the rain fall in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.65,0:18:31.65,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I will refine the world
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.73,0:18:34.17,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}to make our palm lines say
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.37,0:18:36.53,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}that we will live forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.53,0:18:39.45,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Walking off the beaten path
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.45,0:18:42.53,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}through heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.81,0:18:49.49,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Before returning to dust,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.73,0:18:49.49,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}I will refine this mortal body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.01,0:18:58.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}The left shore is the joyous laughter
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.89,0:18:58.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}that can brighten up a thousand years of sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.37,0:19:04.97,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}The right shore is an eternal silence
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.97,0:19:04.97,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}lingering under the candlelight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.17,0:19:07.85,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}To overturn this fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.85,0:19:12.21,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}I will walk against the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.65,0:19:19.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}I will even gather the clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.17,0:19:19.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}to illuminate the sky for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.77,0:19:23.61,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}All this sadness was not meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.61,0:19:26.93,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}How many lives and deaths\Nhave passed in the blink of an eye ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.93,0:19:32.73,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}I vow to break
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.17,0:19:32.73,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}this chess game of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.05,0:19:43.69,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,1500)}I vow to break
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.85,0:19:43.69,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,1500)}this chess game of fate.
